units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 23.5 63.5 units lattice
create_box 2 projectile
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
mass 1 92.906
mass 2 92.906
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb Nb
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
velocity group 1 set 0 0 2000 sum yes
unfix 1
fix 2 all nve
run 500000
